WEBVTT

00:00.070 --> 00:01.440
My name is Jordan Cowan

00:01.610 --> 00:03.700
and I created Aussie Aussie Easy.

00:03.757 --> 00:05.557
Three years ago I moved to Australia

00:05.567 --> 00:07.327
and had the most incredible time

00:07.527 --> 00:09.227
and I really want to help you

00:09.437 --> 00:10.667
do the exact same thing.

00:10.763 --> 00:12.483
I've created a guide with everything

00:12.493 --> 00:13.443
that you need to know

00:13.598 --> 00:15.333
but I'm giving away my time

00:15.393 --> 00:16.923
a free 30-minute chat

00:16.933 --> 00:18.533
to run you through everything there is

00:18.553 --> 00:20.023
to help you get settled down quickly

00:20.033 --> 00:21.883
and have the most incredible experience.

00:22.027 --> 00:23.307
If you are heading down under

00:23.317 --> 00:24.377
let's book a quick chat.
